docs {
  # VULN-06: Mass Assignment & Missing Field Whitelisting
  
  ## Objective:
  Demonstrate that `updateStory` blindly spreads `...req.body` into `findByIdAndUpdate`, allowing an attacker to overwrite protected ownership fields (`createdBy`).
  
  ## How to test:
  1. Click Send.
  2. Notice the response returns 200 OK and `createdBy` was successfully overwritten to `"000000000000000000000000"`!
  3. Capture a screenshot for your BEFORE evidence!
}
